{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forgotten Signal: Portal </strong>is an exciting first-person shooter (FPS) adventure game that combines science fiction, mystery, horror and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761280/extras/Cupboard.gif?t=1748355197\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Talent System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the game, you start with 3 different talents:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wall Vision</strong>: When this talent is used, the enemy\u2019s location is revealed. You can use this talent when you\u2019re curious about whether an enemy is approaching or where they are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761280/extras/Wall_Vision.gif?t=1748355197\" />  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Invisibility</strong>: With this talent, you become invisible, and the enemy cannot see you. You can use this talent when you\u2019re about to die or want to sneak into rooms and take items from beside the enemy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761280/extras/Invisibility.gif?t=1748355197\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stop</strong>: With this talent, you can stop enemies, leaving them motionless. You can use this talent when you\u2019re about to die or want to get away from an enemy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761280/extras/Stop.gif